OL,3,GNEWSACriticism as council spend on
OL,4,Amural almost doubles
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council in Nottinghamshire is facing
OL,7,Fcriticism after spending #47,000 on a
OL,8,Fnew mural, almost double the original
OL,9,Fcost.
OL,11,FThe mural, on both sides of the A1
OL,12,Funderpass in Lincoln Road, Tuxford,
OL,13,Fdepicts elements of Tuxford's history
OL,14,Fand heritage in a bid to improve the
OL,15,Flook of the underpass.
OL,17,FBassetlaw District Council said #25,000
OL,18,Fwas set aside for the project, but
OL,19,Fcosts increased when it was told safety
OL,20,Fmeasures were needed to protect the
OL,21,Fartists and pedestrians.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
