OL,3,GNEWSACriticism as council spend on
OL,4,Amural almost doubles
OL,5,
OL,6,FDistrict councillor Lewis Stanniland
OL,7,Fquestioned how the costs "ballooned",
OL,8,Fbut the council said the safety
OL,9,Fmeasures, including traffic lights,
OL,10,F"significantly contributed to the
OL,11,Fadditional costs".
